      "ordinaryCost": "Previously allowed ordinary reader-and-commit compound can stop UNKNOWN.",
      "exit": "Keep operation, target and execution context; split reader and commit for a new staged scan only when equivalent, otherwise ask owner. Explicit no-pager or known cat/empty are separate supported controls, not an automatic equivalent to a required pager."
